  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2301.19 Hearing and Appeal. Prior to denying an application or a renewal application or suspending or revoking a certificate issued under this part, a certificate holder shall be provided with written notice of the commissioner's allegations and provided an opportunity for a hearing as provided in RSA 400-A and Ins 200.\n\nSource. #5787, eff 2-14-94; ss by #7023, eff 7-1-99; ss by #7318, eff 8-1-00, EXPIRED: 8-1-08\n\nNew. #9510, eff 7-10-09; ss by #12228, eff 7-10-17",
